# Jak 1: one of Boggy Swamp's tether rocks breaks, its scene plays, and Jak walks off after it (LIST-0.1.6 item 27, a
# player on 0.1.5: "cutscene after blasting rock in boggy swamp glues your feet to ground", then "i tried a different
# rock that does the same thing"). Run with JAKVR_TEST_CONTINUE=swamp-start, JAKVR_TEST_WARP=swamp-tetherrock-13,
# JAKVR_TEST_TETHER=1, QUEST_SIM_ALIGN=10000 and JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1: a new game, the continue, then Jak put a metre over
# the rock (frame 10000 is that moment); 3 seconds on, the rock takes a hit of his yellow eco (pc-vr.gc
# vr-test-tether!) and its scene holds him (target-grab). After it he must be let go (target-stance), walk with the left
# stick and jump with A. Pictures through the scene and after it. The rock's power cell lands on him (its victory), and
# with no save slot (a sim's new game) its auto-save opens the game's save menu as he starts to walk: A there, then he
# walks and jumps again.
